 "summary": "ZH is a single-row wire-to-board connector family on a 1.5 mm pitch. Wires crimped into SZH contacts sit in a ZHR housing, which plugs into a fully shrouded header with round pins on the board. S4B-ZR-SM4A-TF is the 4-circuit surface-mount side-entry header with two soldered reinforcement tabs, 3.7 mm tall and 9.0 mm wide, on embossed tape. The family runs from 2 to 13 circuits in through-hole top and side entry, SMT side entry with bosses, and SMT top and side entry with tabs; it is rated 1.0 A (AWG #26) and 50 V AC/DC over -25 to +85 °C.",
